Package: perglm
Title: Permutation Score Tests for Generalized Linear Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ziang", "Niu", , "ziangniu@upenn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description:
    Permutation-calibrated, empirically studentized
    score tests in generalized linear models, following Ai and Niu (2026)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2611.03255>. Fits a nuisance-only null model once and
    uses cached score quantities and compiled numerical kernels for fixed-budget
    permutation calibration. Supports Gaussian, Bernoulli, Poisson, Gamma,
    inverse Gaussian, and negative-binomial working models.
URL: https://ziangniu6.github.io/perglm/, https://github.com/ZiangNiu6/perglm
BugReports: https://github.com/ZiangNiu6/perglm/issues
License: GPL (>= 3)
